{"unit_id":"Senguk520__dsh-multitask#feature-feature-1","repo":"Senguk520/dsh-multitask","commit":"d9e4fe8f50f76456dfe65d3614526518a32ea993","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-multitask 的功能「协调者工具范围」：主会话使用 Multitask preset 后保留只读检查、委派和结果管理等工具；执行型任务可由 worker 处理。该模式通过 preset 对会话工具目录进行配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["presets/multitask/coordinator-guard.mjs:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"Senguk520__dsh-multitask#feature-feature-2","repo":"Senguk520/dsh-multitask","commit":"d9e4fe8f50f76456dfe65d3614526518a32ea993","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-multitask 的功能「四类子代理」：提供标准、继承已完成上下文、PTC 和只读四种子代理路径，按任务形态分配工作；两种扩展后端由插件注册。","source":"generated","evidence":["presets/multitask/composition.mjs:41-72"]}
{"unit_id":"Senguk520__dsh-multitask#feature-feature-3","repo":"Senguk520/dsh-multitask","commit":"d9e4fe8f50f76456dfe65d3614526518a32ea993","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-multitask 的功能「跨模式委派」：协调者可查看已注册的 agent preset 列表，并按 preset id 启动另一个模式的 worker，取得其子会话 id 与结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["presets/multitask/preset-dispatch.mjs:194-203"]}
{"unit_id":"Senguk520__dsh-multitask#feature-feature-4","repo":"Senguk520/dsh-multitask","commit":"d9e4fe8f50f76456dfe65d3614526518a32ea993","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-multitask 的功能「子代理审批转发」：当 worker 遇到需要确认的操作时，审批闸门可把请求转发到父会话等待处理，并提供失败通知路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["presets/multitask/approval-gate.mjs:1012-1018"]}
